              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lino nebwakaca buzuba bwatatu kwakaba mizumo amalabi ajoba idemu atala acilundu, alimwi kwakamvwigwa mweembo wabukali, mane bantu boonse bamuzilao bakakankama. ",
          "type": "text",
